  "description": "A lightweight, high-performance, AoT-compatible .NET library for generating and working with ULIDs (Universally Unique Lexicographically Sortable Identifiers). Supports monotonic ULID generation, Base32 encoding, and cross-platform compatibility. Ideal for databases, distributed systems, and scenarios requiring unique, sortable, timestamped identifiers.",
